@attribute [Route($"{GlobalValues.Root_Path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_DataTable}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Quirks_Issues}")]

<PageTitle>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Data_Table @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Quirks_Issues</PageTitle>

<section class="@GlobalValues.Info_Box_Class @GlobalValues.Info_Box_Coloured_Modifier">
    <h1 class="@GlobalValues.Info_Box_Heading_Class">@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Data_Table @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Quirks_Issues</h1>

    <p>
        Below are all the quirks and/or issues that I experienced whilst testing the Data Table component.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="section-box">
    <h2 id="screen-reader-quirks" class="@GlobalValues.Info_Box_Heading_Class">Screen reader quirks</h2>
    <ul aria-labelledby="screen-reader-quirks">
        <li>
            <b>VoiceOver</b> on macOS/iOS still not announce the <span class="code-span">aria-sort</span> operation/change, so the Data Table makes
            a live region announcement to compensate.
        </li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        During the development of both the Data Table and Pager I encountered issues with JAWS in that it loses its internal buffer/index synchronisation with the DOM. 
        This can translate into the following sequence of events. A user (when the Virtual Cursor is active) is focused on a button, presses to activate it, but JAWS 
        will move the focus to some other element or send both the focus and click event to a different button on the page. 
    </p>
    <p>
        This only seems to occur when the application uses the Blazor Auto (Server and WASM) per page template, and only when interactive components are on a page that has pre-rendering disabled.
    </p>
    <p>
        I have logged this bug with both the JAWS and Blazor teams, you can view those using the following links:  <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Class" target="_blank" href="@GlobalValues.JAWS_Issues_Link_FS">Issue logged against JAWS #959</a>.
        and <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Class" target="_blank" href="@GlobalValues.JAWS_Issues_Link_Blazor">Issue logged against Blazor #68157 (opens in new window)</a>
    </p>
</section>


<div class="flex-content justify-content-between">
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Left_Arrow_Modifier" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_Path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_DataTable}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Overview_Tests}")">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Data_Table - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Overview_Tests</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Right_Arrow_Modifier" href="@($"{GlobalValues.Root_Path_Components}/{GlobalValues.Component_Path_Part_DebounceFilter}/{GlobalValues.Common_Page_Path_Overview_Tests}")">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Component_Name_Debounce_Filter - @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Overview_Tests</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
</div>
